# The healer's harness.
#
# Same tools as the doer, and deliberately not the same station. Its prompt is
# the difference, and the difference matters: the doer is told to find something
# worth improving, so handing it a list of findings gives it one more thing
# competing with the job it was already given, and on a loop it starts something
# new instead of fixing what failed.
#
# Give a machine one job. Repair is not the doer's job.
TOOLS="read,edit,write,grep,find,ls,run_tests"
MODEL="anthropic/claude-opus-4-7"
EXTENSION="extensions/run-tests-tool.ts"
